# Google Sheets — Google Sheets API via service account
# Setup:
# 1. Go to Google Cloud Console → IAM & Admin → Service Accounts
# 2. Create a service account, grant it "Editor" role
# 3. Create a JSON key and download it
# 4. Share your Google Sheet with the service account email (Editor access)
# 5. Create three sheets (tabs) inside the file: "Demo Requests", "Contact", and "Get Started"
# 6. Add the headers below as the first row of each sheet:
#
#    Demo Requests: Timestamp | Full Name | Organization | Email | Phone | Org Type | Worker Count | Payroll Type | Payment Channels | Message
#    Contact:       Timestamp | Name | Email | Phone | Message
#    Get Started:   Timestamp | Name | Business | Phone | Email | Team Size

GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_EMAIL=your-service-account@your-project.iam.gserviceaccount.com
GOOGLE_PRIVATE_KEY="-----BEGIN RSA PRIVATE KEY-----\n...\n-----END RSA PRIVATE KEY-----\n"
GOOGLE_SHEET_ID=your_google_sheet_id_from_the_url
